    "description": "This is a 3 story building with a unit on each floor.  The charming living room bay windows not only provide plenty of natural light, they also allow you to enjoy iconic views of the Golden Gate Bridge.  The master bedrooms on the second and third floors also are elevated by elegant bay windows that pour in natural light and create a sense of openness and calm. Each floor offers a generously sized three-bedroom, two-bath residence spanning approximately 1,500 square feet\u2014designed for both comfort and style.  The ground floor features a spacious two-car garage with high ceilings\u2014ideal for installing a lift to accommodate up to four vehicles.  In addition, there is a two-bedroom, one-bath unit of of approximately 1,000 permitted square feet on the ground level. Whether you're looking for an owner-occupied option or a smart investment opportunity, this flexible layout offers both comfort and value."
